==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 1)]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2.67~13.33 seconds<sup>80f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 2)]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 1)]] spawn, delay 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
**3 [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|Yurinchis]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Princess Punt has incredibly high range but weak stats. Try to rush her down with tanks like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] or rushers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]].

